ATTRIBUTION

The prose rule restates, in compressed form, the ruleset of the `caveman`
plugin by Julius Brussee (MIT, https://github.com/JuliusBrussee).

The code rule restates, in compressed form, the ruleset of the `ponytail`
plugin by Dietrich Gebert (MIT, https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail).

Both plugins are MIT licensed, and this plugin carries a short form of each
rule rather than a copy of either file. Install either plugin for its full
ruleset, its commands and its agents. This plugin then yields that section.

ASD-STE100 is the aerospace maintenance writing standard of ASD. The bundled
skill carries a reading of its rules. It does not carry the approved
dictionary, and it is not an ASD publication.
